  "hyprland": {
    "version": "0.57.1-1",
    "note": "Not a build pin — mkarchiso still installs whatever CachyOS currently ships. This is only the pacman hyprland version/release (CPU-rebuild .N suffix ignored) that the image was last actually booted and tested on. customize-image.sh compares against it and prints a loud, non-fatal warning in the build log when it changed, so a Hyprland bump (e.g. 0.57's quirks.skip_non_kms_dmabuf_formats breaking rendering on virtio-gpu, found 2026-10-30) doesn't slip into a build unnoticed. Update this value once you've confirmed a build with the new version is fine."
